{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3120, "text": "Hey, gang, how goes the world?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 5860, "text": "Enraged housewife shoots husband's pig\nin bizarre love triangles."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 12940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11300, "text": "Caught him bringing home the bacon, huh?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 17160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16160, "text": "Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 21720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17460, "text": "Hey, hi, guy. How you doing? Fine, just\nfine. Good to see you all. Oh, good to"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 24940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21720, "text": "see you. Who the hell is this guy?"}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 27640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26520, "text": "Haven't got a clue."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 30760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28540, "text": "So, Harry, how are your pet rabbits\nworms?"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 33929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33009, "text": "Thank you, Al."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 34970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33930, "text": "Tell them you asked."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 40190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36970, "text": "Excuse me, but you have us at a\ndisadvantage. We don't know your name."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 42270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40730, "text": "Wait, I remember now."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 46110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42750, "text": "His name is, uh, uh... It's Bill."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 47690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46690, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 51930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48790, "text": "No, I'm pretty sure it is. We met at\nyour Christmas party."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52170, "text": "Christmas. I was also at your Halloween\nparty, the New Year's Eve luau, and your"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 58390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55630, "text": "birthday. Oh, I get it. You're my\ncaterer. Hey!"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 62360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58960, "text": "This guy is tremendous. He can make a\nmeatloaf that looks like Dizzy"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 63360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62360, "text": "face."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 66260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64400, "text": "I'm afraid I'm not following. Hi,\neverybody."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 69040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66720, "text": "Hi. I see you found Bill."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 70260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69260, "text": "Who? Me."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 71460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 70460, "text": "I got it."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 72920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71920, "text": "George."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 77960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76480, "text": "So, what brings you around?"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 79360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 78280, "text": "Oh, not much."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 83100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80040, "text": "We just wanted to announce we're getting\nmarried, that's all."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 94610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90670, "text": "Mary? Can you top that?"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 97170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95110, "text": "Bigfoot reveals miracle diet."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 146700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 145000, "text": "So, we'll meet back here on my break\naround nine?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 149620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 147060, "text": "That's good for me. I am going to pencil\nyou in."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 152440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151440, "text": "Quite a guy."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 153600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152600, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 156620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 154080, "text": "Got all the charisma of a three -bean\nsalad."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 159980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158940, "text": "See you later, sweetheart."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 161580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160580, "text": "Affirmative."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 165360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163240, "text": "What a disgusting display."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 169160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 167000, "text": "I get more action fishing for my keys."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 182620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179880, "text": "Well, well, well, well, well, well,\nwell."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 185160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183500, "text": "I guess you're a little shocked, aren't\nyou?"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 188760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 185660, "text": "Well... Actually, I'm a little shocked\nmyself."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 193120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 189580, "text": "You know, all your life you think love\nis going to be this flash of passion and"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 196660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193120, "text": "romance. It hits you over the head like\na sledgehammer, but it's not like that."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 201740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197220, "text": "It's calm and quiet, and it builds up\nslowly over time."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 203740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 202540, "text": "Kind of like flack."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 206480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 205480, "text": "Beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 208000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206880, "text": "I said, is that a fact?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 218730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216010, "text": "We'll remand this one over to a higher\ncourt."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 227050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221530, "text": "Well... Hey, how's the weather up there?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 232430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 231330, "text": "Listen, you got a sister?"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 240900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236660, "text": "Why don't we throw Christine one of\nthose really filthy X -rated stag"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 243060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241020, "text": "Dan! We'll tell her it's a buffet."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 248000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244700, "text": "But we'll arrange all the little\nsausages in a... Dan!"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 253080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250260, "text": "I guess you don't want to know what's in\nthe watermelon boat, do you?"}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 255000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254000, "text": "I do."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 256860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255860, "text": "What do you got?"}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 258660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257000, "text": "People versus debosians, sir."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 261399, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259320, "text": "Yes, sir. Destruction of property caged\nhere."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 267040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263520, "text": "The Attorney's Authority police arrested\nMr. DeBoson here when they observed him"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 269900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267040, "text": "trying to tamper with a vending machine.\nApparently, he had lost some change in"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 273960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269900, "text": "it and in an attempt to retrieve it, he\ngot a metal object with which he tried"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 278360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273960, "text": "to open the machine and force the coin\nbox, thereby defacing the mechanism of"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 279360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278360, "text": "dispensing the product."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 282820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279740, "text": "Not only the glass... Are you in some\nkind of pain, woman?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 290760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 286460, "text": "I am so sorry, Your Honor. I was just...\nTwisting the night away. Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 296120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292460, "text": "Mr. DeBosian pleads guilty, Your Honor.\nDoes he? Well, then guilty it is. $100"}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 297120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296120, "text": "fine?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 300880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298140, "text": "All right, that's lunch, people. Eat\nthem if you got them."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 306120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302680, "text": "Your Honor, Bill and I would like a\nmoment of your time. Who?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 310880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306340, "text": "Me. Oh, right. Why don't you two\nlovebirds wait in my office? I'll be"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 315760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313660, "text": "And don't do anything I wouldn't do."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 318920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316360, "text": "Could you specify exactly what it is you\nwouldn't do?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 323700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322700, "text": "Oh, I don't think I get it."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 326480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324540, "text": "You won't much after the honeymoon,\neither."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 330580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328940, "text": "I beg your pardon? Come on, Bill."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 334580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333120, "text": "Love is strange, huh?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 337740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 335320, "text": "Yeah. If you know what you're doing."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 349540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342760, "text": "Hey, kids, make yourselves"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 350519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349540, "text": "at home."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 351520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350520, "text": "Excuse me, Harry."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 353070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351950, "text": "What is this thing?"}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 356150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354350, "text": "Are you serious? That's a slinky."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 358870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357870, "text": "Slinky?"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 360550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 359330, "text": "And what do you do with it?"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 362330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361330, "text": "You do this."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 368510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367510, "text": "Why?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 370930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369850, "text": "Because it's fun."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 374250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 372590, "text": "Huh. Ah."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 377350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374870, "text": "Better put it away before we bust a gut,\nhuh?"}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 380990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379570, "text": "So, what's your line of work?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 383700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381340, "text": "He's an actuary for all the top\ninsurance companies."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 387460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 384780, "text": "Insurance. Golly, who would have\nguessed?"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 392580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388440, "text": "Bill discovered the statistical link\nbetween a sedentary lifestyle and colon"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 397020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 392580, "text": "polyps. We should discuss that sometime."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 398480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397420, "text": "Perhaps over dinner."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 403940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402680, "text": "So when's the big event?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 405920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 404680, "text": "Ten months from now."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 408580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406560, "text": "And we want you to marry us, sir."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 412230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409890, "text": "Specifically, December 23rd at 145."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 414690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413690, "text": "I'm busy."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 418030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 416790, "text": "Gee, that's too bad."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 419450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418450, "text": "That's a joke."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 423930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419630, "text": "Come on, what kind of idiot would\nschedule something ten months in advance"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 424930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423930, "text": "to the minute?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 429830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428830, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 433750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430470, "text": "Hey, I tell you what. Would you give\nChristine and I just a couple of minutes"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 437670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433750, "text": "alone to have a chat, huh? Oh, I don't\nmind at all. I'm sure I'll find some way"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 438670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437670, "text": "to amuse myself."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 441570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438830, "text": "Well, if you get too bored, you can\nalways count the holes in the acoustical"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 442570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441570, "text": "tiling."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 444610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443610, "text": "Oh, wow."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 451310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 449850, "text": "So, what do you think?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 455490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451770, "text": "Oh, I really, really like his shoes."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 459670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456530, "text": "He has the largest collection of\nwingtips in the state. I knew that."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 462770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461310, "text": "Miss Sullivan, may I be frank?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 463929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463150, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 465910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463930, "text": "Your friend, he's kind of a..."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 469120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466200, "text": "What you would call, uh, how do you say\nit? He's, uh... Interesting?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 473340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470120, "text": "Well, in a dietary fiber sort of way."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 478260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474980, "text": "What are you trying to say, sir? Well,\nit's just that anybody who didn't know"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 482720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478260, "text": "him the way you do might find him sort\nof... dull."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 485620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484620, "text": "Dull?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 488360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485800, "text": "Of course, they'd be missing his fun\nside."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 493300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490400, "text": "500 ,386 holes in the tiling."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 499850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497190, "text": "practically have to rip the lampshade\noff his head."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 504970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501950, "text": "Well, I will admit he's not into\noutrageous behavior."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 509950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505970, "text": "Miss Sullivan, he's not into lifelike\nbehavior."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 515049, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511950, "text": "What? All right, I know it's probably\nnone of my business. That's right."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 516610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515270, "text": "It's none of your business."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 520350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516970, "text": "Hey, I am only thinking of you. You\nknow, just because a person doesn't like"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 522530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520350, "text": "pull paper snakes out of his nostrils\ndoesn't make him dumb."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 525430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523530, "text": "You never even gave that trick a chance."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 529950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525890, "text": "You know, you are prejudging him just\nbecause he's not a skinny, ridiculous"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 531190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529950, "text": "adolescent clown."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 533470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532090, "text": "I am not skinny."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 541240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536680, "text": "You know, I was probably wrong. You two\nare perfect for each other. You dot all"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 544840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541240, "text": "your I's, you cross all your T's, you\nschedule and plan the fun out of"}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 546260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544840, "text": "everything, and you know why?"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 550640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546520, "text": "Because you are afraid of life. Oh, that\nis not true!"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 555060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550860, "text": "You name one spontaneous thing you have\never done. Just one."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 558780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557780, "text": "Bill!"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 561680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 558980, "text": "We're not getting married ten months\nfrom now. We're getting married tonight!"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 568180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567180, "text": "Good example."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 582940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 581940, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 585680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583660, "text": "I got the marriage license."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 587840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586640, "text": "Well, that was quick."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 589260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588140, "text": "Oh, I pulled a few strings."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 594920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590460, "text": "Now, you've got to sign right here."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 604970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601170, "text": "Oh, think of it, John. In just a few\nshort hours, our little Christine is"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 606350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604970, "text": "actually going to get married."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 609950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608950, "text": "By you."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 615250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612330, "text": "I pity the slob who's still carrying the\ntorch for her."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 620730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617330, "text": "His gut should be twisting in the wind\nright now."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 627050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621610, "text": "In fact, I've got the antacid right\nhere, sir."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 632470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631470, "text": "The nummies are here."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 635610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634470, "text": "Oh, you bought a cake?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 638050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 636150, "text": "The bakery had a last -minute\ncancellation."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 643810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641050, "text": "Happy 50th anniversary, Sam and Flora."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 647610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645930, "text": "Sam had a heart attack this morning."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 651110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 649170, "text": "I guess this is Christine's lucky day."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 656770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654410, "text": "Maybe we could trade him to China for a\npanda."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 659790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658790, "text": "Mac, what's left?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 664300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 660080, "text": "Just the I do, sir. No more cases? Uh\n-uh. Nothing at all? Only the power"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 665300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664300, "text": "in you."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 669600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666660, "text": "Well, then, let the joyous festivities\nbegin."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 671700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670520, "text": "Folks, we're adjourned."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 679700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 675660, "text": "Well, I hope I'm not late. I got started\non a three -axis spreadsheet, and"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 682340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 679700, "text": "before I knew it, I was up to my neck in\nmultivariate statistics."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 686740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685020, "text": "Don't you just love it when they talk\ndirty?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 692280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690280, "text": "Let's gather around and get this thing\nover with."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 695040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 693700, "text": "Everybody say cheese."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 703640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 701640, "text": "Darn it, my pictures never turn out."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 711880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 706640, "text": "Bull, you do know you have to wait 60\nseconds for the picture to develop."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 729140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728140, "text": "had that camera?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 730720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729720, "text": "Seven years."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 734420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733040, "text": "Four vacations."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 736740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735200, "text": "The flying saucer."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 739720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737700, "text": "The time I met Rula Lenska."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 743320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742320, "text": "Okay, then."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 749900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744460, "text": "Dearly beloved, and all creatures great\nand small,"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 755660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 750020, "text": "we are gathered here to join these two\npeople in the bonds of holy wedlock."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 762980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756620, "text": "which is a word that's made up of two\nother words, wed, meaning to marry, and"}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 769100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 762980, "text": "lock, meaning to affix permanently,\nwhich brings another topic to mind, that"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 771660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769100, "text": "locks and hardware, other hardware."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 772939, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772000, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 777300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772940, "text": "Yeah? Perhaps we could speed things up\nif you only said things that actually"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 778300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 777300, "text": "made sense."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 781220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780220, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 787000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785840, "text": "You know who you are."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 790960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787580, "text": "Do you take this woman to be your\nlawfully wedded wife to have and to hold"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 794500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790960, "text": "through sickness and health, rich or\npoor, as long as you both shall live?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 795920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794760, "text": "I do. Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 797920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796180, "text": "Yes. Okay, I'm just asking."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 800880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 799160, "text": "You don't have to bite my head off."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 812440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 805560, "text": "And do you, Christine Sullivan, take\nthis man to be"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 814100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812440, "text": "your lawfully wedded husband?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 822440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815560, "text": "to have and to hold through sickness and\nhealth, rich or poor, for"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 824400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822440, "text": "as long as you both shall live."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 865740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863920, "text": "cost me over $200."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 868920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866220, "text": "I can believe it. It's not leaking at\nall."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 874540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873540, "text": "Wow."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 875880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874880, "text": "It's true."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 880120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877880, "text": "You wait long enough, it does come out."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 881780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880780, "text": "Look at this."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 883340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882340, "text": "Whoa."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 892160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889860, "text": "These are the times of our lives."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 905880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904880, "text": "Humiliated, mortified."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 908760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906800, "text": "Come on, what's there to be embarrassed\nabout?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 912960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910540, "text": "I threw up in a briefcase at my own\nwedding."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 915960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914960, "text": "Besides that."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 919680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918000, "text": "I don't know, it must have been all the\nexcitement."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 924580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921860, "text": "Christine, can I make an observation\nhere?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 926320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925320, "text": "Feel free."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 928200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 926880, "text": "Your fiancé's a dud."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 932520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930120, "text": "Ron, you don't even know him. He's\njust..."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 935720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933980, "text": "Honey, my parking spot is reserved."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 939080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937600, "text": "That guy's a paperweight."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 943480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 940500, "text": "Oh, Roz, not you too. Why is everybody\nagainst it?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 945060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944040, "text": "Forget everybody."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 946840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 945840, "text": "What about you?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 948860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947260, "text": "What, you think this is a mistake too?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 951040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 949500, "text": "I think you should do what you want."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 953200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 951800, "text": "Just be sure about it."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 957540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 954020, "text": "I mean, you're going to have to live\nwith this decision for the next 40 or 50"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 958540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957540, "text": "years."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 961480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960440, "text": "47 .3."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 964460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963420, "text": "Bill figured that out."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 967820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966000, "text": "It's a long time to go between laughs."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 970920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968700, "text": "And you do seem to like people who make\nyou laugh."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 974140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971520, "text": "Oh, the next thing you'll be telling me\nis I belong with someone like Harry."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 976700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975080, "text": "Harry? Come on."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 979760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977840, "text": "Harry's the kind that'll give you\nnothing but fun."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 983920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 981860, "text": "Warmth. One good time after another."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 987520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985220, "text": "47 .3 years of that, and where are you?"}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 992310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991310, "text": "I gotta run."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 997710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996710, "text": "You okay?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1000110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999110, "text": "Yeah, I'm fine."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1001690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000550, "text": "I'll be there in a minute."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1003450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002450, "text": "Take your time."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1010750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004810, "text": "But whatever you decide, and I can't\nstress this enough, cock that ring."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1023430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020430, "text": "I managed to pick up the letters on the\ncake with a knife and rearrange them"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1024429, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023430, "text": "into something more appropriate."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1027290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025810, "text": "Love is my saliva."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1032450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030910, "text": "I had to work with what was there."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1037310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036310, "text": "How is she?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1038589, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037450, "text": "About two pounds lighter."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1040170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038890, "text": "That's statistically impossible."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1041750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040690, "text": "Not in our cafeteria."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1044230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1043230, "text": "Is she coming back?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1045790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044790, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1047730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046569, "text": "I'm sorry for the delay."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1049880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048880, "text": "Shall we continue?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1051660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050320, "text": "Are you sure you're all right?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1053340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051900, "text": "Oh, I'm fine. Why do you ask?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1057000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053880, "text": "Well, a minute ago you did Lego your\nego."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1060820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058780, "text": "Oh, I've forgotten all about that."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1062500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061220, "text": "Maybe this will ring a bell."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1068600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1066120, "text": "And they say there's always room for\njello."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1073800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071700, "text": "If we could continue."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1076320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074640, "text": "Yeah, okay, let's regroup."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1079510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078510, "text": "Where was I?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1081830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1080150, "text": "I believe you were up to Christine."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1083350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082350, "text": "So I was."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1092730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087110, "text": "Miss Sullivan, do you take this man to\nbe your lawfully wedded husband, to have"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1099150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1092730, "text": "and to hold through sickness and health,\nrich or poor, as long as you both shall"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1100150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099150, "text": "live?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1102970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1101970, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1112139, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1111139, "text": "No?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1116380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115380, "text": "No?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1123720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1118720, "text": "At least he's taking it well."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1130020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125120, "text": "Bill, I'm so sorry. I'm truly sorry.\nIt's horribly unfair to you, but I just"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1131900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1130020, "text": "decided I can't go through with this."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1133800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1132600, "text": "I hope you understand."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1144560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143560, "text": "You get what?"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1149020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144800, "text": "Everything. Every joke I've ever heard.\nMy God, now I get it."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1153400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151760, "text": "$20, same as in town."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1156900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155080, "text": "Take my wife, please."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1160620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1159100, "text": "To get to the other side."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1166900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164300, "text": "I heard my Aunt Letitia laugh like that\nonce."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1170840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168880, "text": "Right before she broke out the meat axe."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1181910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175690, "text": "You should know, in one illuminating\nflash, I realized what a dull, dry,"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1184610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182090, "text": "predictable life I've been leading."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1187510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185210, "text": "No, Phil, I wouldn't say that."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1193230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187870, "text": "Well, of course you wouldn't, because\nyou're as dull, dry, and predictable as"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1194230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1193230, "text": "used to be."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1200930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195710, "text": "My God, I almost married you. Talk about\ndodging a bullet."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1202870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201750, "text": "Hey, do you get it?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1212840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209740, "text": "I'm so glad I came to my senses before I\ndid anything permanent."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1219480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213040, "text": "Hey, sweetheart, do yourself a favor.\nTake your cork out before it's too late."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1231220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227180, "text": "What's the matter with you?"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1233540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231920, "text": "Weddings are just so..."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1239780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238160, "text": "let's get you out of those wet things."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1245580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1241200, "text": "Oh, gee, golly, Ned, would you look at\nthe time? I've got to alphabetize my"}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1250420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245580, "text": "felonies. Yeah, and I'd better get to\nthe cafeteria before they take the skin"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1251420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250420, "text": "off the pudding."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1261540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255520, "text": "Are you okay?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1265020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264020, "text": "I'm fine."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1269170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267230, "text": "I'm real sorry things didn't work out."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1272390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270270, "text": "I know that that was not easy for you."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1275850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274290, "text": "No, I'm fine, really."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1279010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278010, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1286190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1282810, "text": "And thank you. For what? For not saying\nI told you so."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1288510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287510, "text": "Anytime."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1300470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1299470, "text": "No,"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1302790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301790, "text": "you first, please. No, you."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1309990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305410, "text": "I... I just wanted to tell you that...\nYeah."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1314090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312670, "text": "I found the Epstein file."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1317170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316170, "text": "Good, good."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1320370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317290, "text": "I was just going to ask you about the\nEpstein file."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1323350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320630, "text": "What, you really? Isn't that funny? We\nwere both going to say the same thing."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1325690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324690, "text": "That's funny."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1334930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1330670, "text": "i'll see you tomorrow yeah see you\ntomorrow"}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1366640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364940, "text": "Yeah, almost had a wedding."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1368540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367260, "text": "But we didn't."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1370420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1369420, "text": "Too bad."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1372900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1370680, "text": "Yeah, too bad."}
